Bug 2085116 - Skip empty offline IMAP undo transactions. r=mkmelin

Create offline undo transactions only when their header lists are nonempty, avoiding an uninitialized moveCopyOpType read and empty undo entries when all operations are cancelled.

Add regression coverage for cancelled, ordinary, and mixed offline moves with both mbox and maildir stores.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338583

